# Dependencies & build artifacts (installed/regenerated inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/out
**/build
**/.pnpm-store

# Local DB & runtime data (production data lives on the Fly volume)
**/data/ff14kotei.db
**/data/ff14kotei.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Env files — secrets go via fly secrets, never baked into the image
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test/coverage
**/coverage
**/.vitest

# Dev/editor files
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/.worktrees
*.log

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Documentation (not needed at runtime, except CLAUDE.md for agents)
docs
manual
notes
ops
inbox
*.md
!CLAUDE.md

# Claude / local agent state
.claude
